# Summary

The bylaws' lending rule for books is: Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws.[[cite:obs-e2bdc1939dcc94188a6635d103d2f3fd3b80badb "Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws."]]

The excerpt does not state a specific duration for how long a member may keep borrowed books; it refers all loan conditions to the loan table.[[cite:obs-e2bdc1939dcc94188a6635d103d2f3fd3b80badb "Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws."]]
